# Icon source drop. Only the six assets the header's quick actions are actually
# drawn from are released; the rest of the supplied collection stays local
# rather than being shipped by accident. Each file below is the single source
# for one icon: the build inlines it into index.html, so nothing in the page
# duplicates a drawing that also lives here.
IconesNote-it/*
!IconesNote-it/bucket-svgrepo-com.svg
!IconesNote-it/larger-text-svgrepo-com.svg
!IconesNote-it/text-svgrepo-com.svg
!IconesNote-it/edite-svgrepo-com.svg
!IconesNote-it/Category.svg
!IconesNote-it/Search.svg
!IconesNote-it/attach-svgrepo-com5.svg
